            "notes": "---\n\n## \ud83d\udd25 **POWERSPIKE** \ud83d\udd25\n\n---\n\n# \ud83e\uddff Items\n\nNow you should be around ~20k money. We will pivot on AP.\n\nTake  [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) or  [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) depending on what power you started.\n\nTake  [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) and  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) in priority. \nNow when you'll TP on someone you'll do a big healing AOE where you TP.\n\n*Why CDR? Because the more you spam your TP and suzu, the more you'll heal and guess what... you'll get more money. It's always about money.*\n\nIf you need survival, think about buying  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0).\n\n---\n\n# \ud83d\udd2b Playstyle\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f If you have a [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1), [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) or [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) you can stick with your tank because they'll most likely try to push into the enemy backline. Use your TP on cooldown, it's a big burst of healing and your clone will participate.\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f Use your Suzu not only as a cleanse tool, but as a **healing tool**. ATM of the game, you'll get enough AP to give ~20% life to your tank with one Suzu. So you can often use it because of  [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b). But watch for your cooldown, especiallyif there is a  [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) / [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) / [Junkrat](hero_3ac20f6c-2bce-45f3-998e-9129cc6e5c05) / ... ult coming.\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f Don't forget your TP and Suzu are an AOE (Area of effect), so try to get multiple team mates in range of your ablities.",
