            "notes": "# \ud83e\uddff Items\n\nWhat do we want? [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction)! So buy  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). If you can't, as always, focus on AP or survival.\n\nDepending on your matchup and on how much the enemy team is rich, you'll maybe need some survival item. You can sacrifice some AP to take  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) or  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) and take  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) next round.\n\nFor the power, take  [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) ONLY IF THERE IS SOMETHING TO CLEANSE or this power is useless. Typically if you play against [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18)+[Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da)+[Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0)+[Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46)+[Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546), it will be useless. Think about  [Crossing Guard](item_bb5252fd-fc6b-4dce-a60a-21b0a0add68f) instead.\n\nAt this point of the game, survival items are **USUALLY** no longer needed. Indeed your shield + heal from suzu are really strong. Keep spamming your TP and Suzu. BUT depending on the matchup and your feeling, you'll maybe need some.\n\n---\n\n# \ud83d\udd2b Playstyle\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f If you took  [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68), focus your Suzu on cleansing effects (such as, Ashe's dynamite, Ana's nade, ...). Note that it works against  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) (hello [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed)).",
