            "notes": "# \ud83e\uddff Items\n\nFinal build, take what you can afford:\n\n-  [Talisman of Velocity](item_9b81fbe9-c5f8-4442-93d5-082b036010a1): I really like that when I play with [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) or [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) for example\n-  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98),  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)  or  [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4): if you need survival/CDR\n-  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce): because we never get enough AP. Take that only if you trust yourself and if the matchup is at your advantage\n-  [Our Bikes](item_d9fa8542-237e-49d5-b6a1-4e910d5c777f): fun and OP stats\n\nFor the power, I like  [Crossing Guard](item_bb5252fd-fc6b-4dce-a60a-21b0a0add68f). Take  [Spirit Veil](item_1772ce7d-37ed-41e4-8bac-d9b260aa59ad) if you need survivability.",
